{"ref":"BDB, רְעוּת","hw":"רְעוּת","html":"† I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">רְעוּת</span></big>  <strong>n.f. fellow (-woman)</strong>;—sf. in recipr. phr. <span dir=\"rtl\">אִשָּׁה מֵאֵת רְעוּתָהּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 11:2\" href=\"/Exodus.11.2\">Ex 11:2</a> (E) <em>each from her fellow</em> (‖ <span dir=\"rtl\">אִישׁ מֵאֵת רֵעֵהוּ</span>, cf. ii. <a data-ref=\"BDB, רֵעַ²\" href=\"/BDB,_רֵעַ²\", dir=\"rtl\">רֵעַ</a> <strong>3</strong>); cf. <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 9:19\" href=\"/Jeremiah.9.19\">Je 9:19</a>; of birds of prey <span dir=\"rtl\">(דַּוּוֹת)</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 34:15\" href=\"/Isaiah.34.15\">Is 34:15</a> cf. v <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 34:16\" href=\"/Isaiah.34.16\">16</a>; people under fig. of sheep <a data-ref=\"Zechariah 11:9\" href=\"/Zechariah.11.9\">Zc 11:9</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">רְעוּתָהּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Esther 1:19\" href=\"/Esther.1.19\">Est 1:19</a> = <em>another than she</em> (cf. <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 15:28\" href=\"/I_Samuel.15.28\">1 S 15:28</a> ii. <a data-ref=\"BDB, רֵעַ²\" href=\"/BDB,_רֵעַ²\", dir=\"rtl\">רֵעַ</a> <strong>2</strong>).","next":"BDB, רוּת²","prev":"BDB, רַעְיָה"}